WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.215 --> 00:00:04.215
- It came true.

00:00:04.215 --> 00:00:07.215
(audience clapping)

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:17.878
This means so much more to me this time.

00:00:17.878 --> 00:00:20.807
I don't know why, I think the first time

00:00:20.807 --> 00:00:24.099
I hardly felt it because
it was all so new.

00:00:24.099 --> 00:00:27.228
I wanna say thank you
to you, I haven't had

00:00:27.228 --> 00:00:30.034
an Orthodox career and I
wanted more than anything

00:00:30.034 --> 00:00:31.460
to have your respect.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:33.663
The first time I didn't
feel it but this time

00:00:33.663 --> 00:00:34.496
I feel it.

00:00:36.252 --> 00:00:38.125
(audience clapping)

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:41.539
(maniacal laughing)

00:00:41.539 --> 00:00:44.706
Oh, thank you, thank you ever so much.

00:00:45.687 --> 00:00:48.770
I'm, and sir you're doing a great job

00:00:50.036 --> 00:00:52.111
but you're so quick with that stick

00:00:52.111 --> 00:00:56.711
so why don't you sit cause
I may never be here again,

00:00:56.711 --> 00:00:59.461
I can't believe this, this is so,

00:01:01.213 --> 00:01:03.184
so quite pretty.

00:01:03.184 --> 00:01:05.342
I want to acknowledge
so many people that made

00:01:05.342 --> 00:01:09.370
Erin Brokovich Erin
Brokovich but first let me

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:10.703
adjust my dress.

00:01:12.137 --> 00:01:15.148
This movie was sinfully fun to make

00:01:15.148 --> 00:01:19.662
and turn off that clock,
it's making me nervous.

00:01:19.662 --> 00:01:21.412
Steven Soderberg, hi!

00:01:24.621 --> 00:01:26.495
(audience clapping)

00:01:26.495 --> 00:01:29.745
Oh my god, oh come on, all right, okay.

00:01:34.354 --> 00:01:37.687
Thank you so much, thank you, thank you.

00:01:38.839 --> 00:01:41.180
When they called my
name I had this feeling

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.691
I could hear half of America going oh no,

00:01:43.691 --> 00:01:45.108
come on her, why,

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:49.047
her, again, you know, and whatever.

00:01:52.183 --> 00:01:54.828
I really want to thank all my colleagues,

00:01:54.828 --> 00:01:56.045
all my friends.

00:01:56.045 --> 00:01:59.258
I look out here and you know I see my life

00:01:59.258 --> 00:02:00.508
before my eyes.

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:06.005
(audience clapping)

00:02:06.005 --> 00:02:08.527
I'm gonna cry because this show has been

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:10.312
as long as my career.

00:02:10.312 --> 00:02:13.312
(audience laughing)

00:02:14.985 --> 00:02:19.783
I have wondered for 26 years
what this would feel like,

00:02:19.783 --> 00:02:23.119
thank you so much for
terminating the suspense.

00:02:23.119 --> 00:02:27.918
He is at work with everyone,
God bless that principle,

00:02:27.918 --> 00:02:30.149
God bless that potential that we all have

00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:34.461
for making anything possible
if we think we deserve it.

00:02:34.461 --> 00:02:36.628
I deserve this, thank you.

